{"cell": "qwen38-27b-openrouter:curie:system_facts_k32", "model": "qwen38-27b-openrouter", "model_id": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "My mother’s name was **Zofia** (Zofia Skłodowska).\n\nMy father was Władysław Skłodowski, a teacher of mathematics and physics. Both of my parents were dedicated educators, and their commitment to learning deeply influenced our household.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b-openrouter:curie:system_facts_k32", "model": "qwen38-27b-openrouter", "model_id": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "My father’s name was Władysław Skłodowska. He was a teacher of mathematics and physics in Warsaw, and like my mother, he deeply valued education, which was the foundation of our household.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
